### Diff and merge tools.

## Which input or operation was refused: the first words of the error.

tools-what-command = tool command
tools-what-external-diff = external diff
tools-what-external-merge = external merge

## Why it was refused.

tools-command-unusable = it is too long, or more than one line
tools-no-diff-tool = no diff tool is configured: set diff.tool in git's configuration, or a command in the preferences
tools-not-in-conflict = { $path } is not in conflict
tools-no-merge-tool = no merge tool is configured: set merge.tool in git's configuration, or a command in the preferences

## Which diff tool was started, where it is not a tool git is configured
## with.

tools-from-preferences = the command from the preferences
